#. type: Content of: <book><bookinfo><abstract><para>
#: doc/index.docbook:40
msgid ""
"&kappname; designs and prints labels on DYMO LabelWriter and LabelManager "
"printers and on ZPL label printers, such as the Altec ATP series and "
"Zebra. It opens and saves <filename>.label</filename> files, so labels move "
"between Linux and Windows unchanged."
msgstr ""

